# a project saved before the palette and the pulse sound (format 4) loads with its settings; the three new ones
# come from each piece's recipe (palette 0 = the stock sound, drums, every hit)
wait 300
turn PRESET 4
expect piece 4
storev4 41
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 4
expect par0 41
expect par24 10
expect par27 70
expect par28 0
expect par29 0
expect par30 100
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par0 41
expect par30 100
